    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Tier 3 (Level 11) — The Magician</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tactical:</strong> When you make an <strong>Mind check</strong> related to <strong>lore, magic, or old-world history</strong>, you can treat any d20 roll of <strong>9 or lower as a 10</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Strategic:</strong> Your deep knowledge increasingly guides faction decisions, but its main impact is felt through your reliable successes at the table.</li>\n</ul>",
